# Force LF in the working tree on every platform. Git normalises to LF in the
# repository either way, but a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks the
# scripts out as CRLF, and `docker build` then bakes `#!/bin/sh\r` into the
# image. The container dies at start with
#
#   exec /entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory
#
# which names the file it just failed to run and is thoroughly misleading.
* text=auto eol=lf
